  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.411 “Emergency medical services instructor (EMS I)” means the primary or assistant instructor licensed by the division to be responsible for instruction conducted in division approved training programs.\n\nSource. #13953, eff 4-30-24",
